      "type": "table",
      "description": "Success, failed, never, missing or running; inspect the matching service/timer. Host sampling must be fresh with nonnegative age. A present future exit timestamp makes the result untrustworthy. Startup failure can lack an exit timestamp and remains a known failed result; no completed attempt is not success.",
