      "id": 24,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Operational next steps",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "[Prometheus Alerts](http://localhost:9090/alerts) · [Alertmanager](http://localhost:9093/#/alerts)\n\nUse the monitoring SSH tunnel for these links. Collection: inspect the metrics service/timer and textfile age. Database: correlate pool acquisition with transaction/lock evidence before resizing. Backup/restore: inspect the latest service result and preserve the last successful timestamp. Logs: check source discovery, retries and dropped entries. Notification failures: inspect Alertmanager and SMTP; do not trigger production failures to validate it.\n\nRelease events and local client diagnostics remain separate evidence; a green Server does not prove client synchronization or search health."
      },
